	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Panasonic AXK680337YG, P5K 0.5mm-pitch 80-pin board-to-board HEADER, 3.0mm mated height, with positioning bosses. Mates the ALINX AC7200 module's AXK580137YG sockets (CON1-4). Land pattern, boss holes (2x 0.8mm NPTH at x=+/-11.05, 1.2mm toward the odd-pin row) and STEP model from SamacSys (cad/AXK680337YG/). Pads match Panasonic's recommended P5K header pattern (con_eng_p5k.pdf: 5.60 outer / 1.00 inner span, 0.25 pads, 0.75 end pads). Odd pins on the +Y row, pin 1 at -X.")
